					"type": "text",
					"value": " serves that page at a different URL, the browser keeps the URL it requested, and "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "usePathname()"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " reads that browser URL on the client rather than the rewrite destination."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "To avoid hydration mismatches, design the UI so that only a small, isolated part depends on the client pathname. Render a stable fallback on the server and update that part after mount. The deferred read shows a brief moment of the fallback before the real pathname appears; see "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
					"title": null,
					"url": "/docs/app/guides/preventing-flash-before-hydration",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "Preventing flash before hydration"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " for techniques that eliminate the visible flicker."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
